          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Oversight Challenges</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Of CFOs report difficulty maintaining visibility across all financial transactions as operations scale.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md text-center">
          <div class="text-indigo-700 text-4xl font-bold mb-2">$1.8M</div>
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Average Annual Loss</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600">The typical mid-market company loses this amount annually to financial waste, fraud, and control gaps.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md text-center">
          <div class="text-indigo-700 text-4xl font-bold mb-2">83%</div>
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Prevention Rate</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Of significant financial control issues can be identified and addressed with proper monitoring systems.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
